    "Apple Intelligence isn't available right now. Your profile and preferences are saved; choose Gemini to create stories." : {
      "comment" : "Localized app copy.",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Intelligence belum tersedia saat ini. Profil dan preferensi tetap tersimpan; pilih Gemini untuk membuat cerita."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple's built-in AI safety service failed (%@, code %lld). The app follows this system check and can't bypass it. Make sure Apple Intelligence is enabled and its language model is ready, then try again." : {
      "comment" : "Localized app copy.",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Layanan keamanan AI bawaan Apple gagal (%1$@, kode %2$lld). Aplikasi mengikuti pemeriksaan sistem ini dan tidak dapat melewatinya. Pastikan Apple Intelligence aktif dan model bahasanya siap, lalu coba lagi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple's language model isn't ready or is still downloading. Connect to Wi-Fi and power, then wait for the download to finish." : {
      "comment" : "Localized app copy.",
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
